11	//! This slice answers function components by the exports the extractor recorded for them (a name, `default`, or the
12	//! property of an exported component a sub-component is attached to); a generic one whose first type parameter
13	//! declares a default is read at that default (`instantiate`). Class components, overloaded components and union props
14	//! types keep their structural result and say why.
